title    Uptown Local
composer Claude (ShooterCoaster)
about    Climbing Gym (level6) option (#456): street funk in E minor at 172. An FM slap bass carries the hook, octave pops and a chromatic run like a rat along the rail, under synth-brass stabs and a guiro scratch; in the B section the brass answers with a line of its own. The last eight bars lift a minor third, to G minor. Layers: bass hook, stabs and scratch from the start, then a broken bigkick beat, snare and clap and hats at 2x, a square wave two octaves over the bass at 3x, sixteenth hats and orchestra hits on the stabs at FRENZY.
tempo    172
beats    4
steps    4
reverb   0.2

# untagged voices are the base layer, the hook among them (layers only add); the intro plays every layer
voice bass   fmbass    vol=0.77 gate=0.7 bright=1.3
voice brass  synbrass  vol=0.60  pan=-0.25 center=B4 gate=0.55 bright=1.3
voice scrape guiro     vol=0.54 pan=0.45
voice rise   riser     vol=0.31
voice kick   bigkick   vol=0.53 layer=drums
voice snare  snare     vol=0.60  pan=0.05 layer=drums
voice clap   clap909   vol=0.48  pan=-0.1 layer=drums
voice hat    hat909    vol=0.41 pan=0.35 layer=drums
voice crash  crash     vol=0.31 pan=-0.2 layer=drums
voice chip   square    vol=0.22 pan=0.2 oct=2 gate=0.7 layer=lead
voice fhat   hat909    vol=0.26 pan=-0.35 layer=frenzy
voice hit    orchhit   vol=0.36  pan=0.1 layer=frenzy

pattern intro
scrape| x.x. x.x. x.x. x.x. | x.x. x.x. xxxx xxxx |
bass  | .--- .--- .--- B1 C2 C#2 D2 | E2!--- .--- .--- B1 C2 C#2 D2 |
brass | [Em7]!-- . [Em7]!-- . [Em7]!------- | .--- .--- .--- .--- |
rise  | _ | E5--------------- |
snare | .... .... .... .... | x.x. x.x. xxxx XXXX |

pattern A
bass  | E2- E3 . D3 E3 . G2- A2 B2- D3 E3- . | E2- E3 . D3 E3 . G2 . A2 Bb2 B2- D3- E3 | A2- A3 . G3 A3 . C#3- B2 A2 G2- E2- . | B2- B3 . A3 B3 . D#3- C3 B2 A2 F#2- D#2- |
chip  | E2- E3 . D3 E3 . G2- A2 B2- D3 E3- . | E2- E3 . D3 E3 . G2 . A2 Bb2 B2- D3- E3 | A2- A3 . G3 A3 . C#3- B2 A2 G2- E2- . | B2- B3 . A3 B3 . D#3- C3 B2 A2 F#2- D#2- |
brass | .--- .- [Em7]- .--- [Em7]!- .- | % | .--- .- [A7]- .--- [A7]!- .- | .--- .- [B7]- .--- [B7]!- .- |
hit   | .--- .- [Em7]- .--- [Em7]!- .- | % | .--- .- [A7]- .--- [A7]!- .- | .--- .- [B7]- .--- [B7]!- .- |
scrape| .... .x.. .... .x.x | % | % | .... .x.. .... xxxx |
kick  | x... ..x. ..x. .... | x... ..x. ..x. ..x. | % | x... ..x. x.x. .x.. |
snare | .... x... .... x..x | % | % | .... x... ..x. x.xx |
clap  | .... x... .... x... | % | % | % |
hat   | x.x. x.x. x.x. x.x. | % | % | % |
crash | X... .... .... .... | _ | _ | _ |
fhat  | xxxx xxxx xxxx xxxx | % | % | % |

pattern A2 from A
bass  | E2- E3 . D3 E3 . G2- A2 B2- D3 E3- . | E2- E3 . D3 E3 . G2 . A2 Bb2 B2- D3- E3 | A2- A3 . G3 A3 . C#3- B2 A2 G2- E2- . | B2- B3 . A3 B3 A3 G3 F#3 E3 D#3 . B2--- |
chip  | E2- E3 . D3 E3 . G2- A2 B2- D3 E3- . | E2- E3 . D3 E3 . G2 . A2 Bb2 B2- D3- E3 | A2- A3 . G3 A3 . C#3- B2 A2 G2- E2- . | B2- B3 . A3 B3 A3 G3 F#3 E3 D#3 . B2--- |
crash | _ | _ | _ | _ |

pattern B from A
bass  | C2- C3 . B2 C3 . E2- G2 C3- B2 C3- . | B1- B2 . A2 B2 . D#2- F#2 B2- A2 B2- . | E2- E3 . D3 E3 . G2- A2 B2- D3 E3- . | A2- A3 . G3 A3 . C#3- B2 A2 G2- E2- . |
chip  | C2- C3 . B2 C3 . E2- G2 C3- B2 C3- . | B1- B2 . A2 B2 . D#2- F#2 B2- A2 B2- . | E2- E3 . D3 E3 . G2- A2 B2- D3 E3- . | A2- A3 . G3 A3 . C#3- B2 A2 G2- E2- . |
brass | G4--- E4- G4- B4--- A4- .- | F#4------- .- D#4- F#4- A4- | G4--- E4- G4- B4--- D5- .- | C#5----- B4- A4- G4- E4--- |
